{"kind": "event", "event": {"model_version": "gemini-2.5-flash", "content": {"parts": [{"text": "A gap of type `online_sellby_breach` means the product is past its online sell-by date and can only be moved through outlets. The policy prefers bundles and transfers over markdowns, so I will draft a transfer play first, then a bundle play, and finally an outlet markdown play.\n\nFor the transfer play, I will choose the outlet with the highest affinity. Since the gap is for SKU-MILK-BREAD-400G at DS-06, and the transfer candidates are OUT-03 and OUT-04, I will choose OUT-03 as it is in the same cluster (South Bengaluru) as DS-06.\n\nFor the bundle play, I will choose the bundle partner with the highest affinity. The bundle partner candidates are SKU-BUTTER-500ML, SKU-PANEER-1L, and SKU-CHEESE-SLICES-500ML. I will choose SKU-BUTTER-500ML as it is a common accompaniment to bread.\n\nFor the outlet markdown play, I will apply a 10% markdown.\n\nAll plays will target all available audience segments, as there is a hard deadline and no benefit to holding reach back. The holdout will be 10% with a unique seed and a minimum of 20 treated customers.\n"}, {"function_call": {"id": "adk-b0e63f04-ee05-428e-969c-b95dffe30c41", "args": {"play_drafts": [{"target": {"batch_ids": ["B-MILK-BREAD-400G-DS-06-01"], "deadline_type": "online_sellby", "units": 124, "deadline_date": "2026-09-16", "node_ids": ["DS-06"], "sku": "SKU-MILK-BREAD-400G"}, "objective": "clear_online_sellby", "holdout": {"fraction": 0.1, "seed": "seed-play_9426bef03a_v1_transfer", "min_treated_n": 20}, "gap_id": "gap_9426bef03a", "mechanic_params": {"transfer_units": 124, "transfer_to_node": "OUT-03"}, "copy": {"language_set": ["en"], "variants": [], "copy_status": "pending"}, "audience": {"segment_ids": ["seg_5", "seg_2", "seg_1", "seg_6", "seg_3", "seg_4"], "size_before_consent": 379, "size_after_consent": 322, "purpose": "marketing"}, "window": {"end": "2026-09-16T23:59:59Z", "start": "2026-09-12T00:00:00Z"}, "channe